}

// `spear-jab`'s steps (CAL-214), where `talk`'s are: by day, the bot, in survival mode, summons a
// husk without AI three blocks south of it, holds an iron spear and jabs south with it twice, its
// `STAB` action, each hurting the husk and knocking it back, then lets it be. It watches for 2
