}

// `golem-call`'s steps (CAL-201), where `piglins`' are: by day, the bot, in creative mode, walls a
// pen west of it in glass two high, so what's in it can't run, and summons three villagers in it
// that slept, as their brains' memories say, the first alone, as vanilla's first villager read
// so takes long enough that its tick comes before the commands after it, then in one tick the
// other two and a vindicator without AI. They panic at the hostile, and a panicking one, every 100
// ticks of the game, as three near it want a golem, `VillagerPanicTrigger`, summons one,
// `spawnGolemIfNeeded`, a place for it drawn up to 8 off, not on glass, `SpawnUtil.trySpawnMob`,
