// `village-cats`' steps (CAL-201), where `golem-call`'s are: by day, the bot, in creative mode,
// sets five red beds in a row south-west of it and summons five villagers by them, the first alone,
// as `golem-call`'s, which claim them, `AcquirePoi`, homes taken. After 12 seconds it turns mob
// spawning on, `spawn_mobs`, monsters, phantoms, patrols and traders off, so the spawners tick,
