        ("tp @s 0.5 -60 6.5", "wolf-tame-back"),
        ("", "wolf-tame-5"), ("", "wolf-tame-6"), ("", "wolf-tame-7"), ("", "wolf-tame-8"),
        ("", "wolf-tame-after"),
    ]
}

// `wolf-breed`'s steps (CAL-201), where `wolves`' are: by day, the bot, in survival mode, summons
