// `rabbits`' steps (CAL-201), where `wolves`' are: by day, the bot, in creative mode, which rabbits
// don't flee, summons a rabbit, which hops about, its jumps and its stroll its own,
// `RabbitMoveControl` and `RabbitJumpControl`. After 8 seconds the bot turns to survival mode and
// the rabbit flees it, `RabbitAvoidEntityGoal`, hopping fast. It watches for 6 seconds.
