// `pufferfish`'s steps (CAL-201), where `salmon`'s are: the bot, in survival mode, with resistance
// III, fills the end portal with stone, CAL-307, digs `cod`'s pool and a small one just east of it,
// and summons a pufferfish in the second, beside it, which puffs up as it's within 2,
// `PufferfishPuffGoal`, heard, grows, and stings it as it touches it, `playerTouch`, hurting and
// poisoning it, game event 9, as it flees; a pig in the first with another pufferfish, which puffs
// up and stings the pig, `touch`; one puffed full without AI, its puff loaded, `PuffState`, in the
// second; and one on land, which flops till it drowns.
// It takes the one without AI in a water bucket, and watches for 30 seconds.
fn pufferfish_steps() -> List<(str, str)> {
    return [
        ("fill 3 -61 -1 5 -61 1 minecraft:stone", "pufferfish-portal"),
        ("time set day", "pufferfish-day"),
        ("gamemode survival", "pufferfish-survival"),
        ("effect give @s resistance 600 2 true", "pufferfish-armor"),
