        ("", "pufferfish-26"), ("", "pufferfish-27"), ("", "pufferfish-28"), ("", "pufferfish-29"), ("", "pufferfish-30"),
        ("", "pufferfish-after"),
    ]
}

// `squid`'s steps (CAL-201), where `pufferfish`'s are: the bot, in survival mode, fills the end
// portal with stone, CAL-307, digs `cod`'s pool and a small one just east of it, and summons a
// squid and a glow squid in the second, two squids and a baby one in the first, and a squid on
// land, which falls and, out of air, drowns. The squids swim about, `SquidRandomMovementGoal`, by
// their tentacles' strokes, entity event 19, turning as they go. It hits the squid in the small
// pool, which squirts its ink, `spawnInk`, and flees, `SquidFleeGoal`, and then the glow squid,
// whose ink glows and which goes dark for 100 ticks. It watches for 30 seconds.
