// `beeflight`'s steps (CAL-177), where `riding`'s are, by day: the bot in creative mode summons
// bees with their AI, one in the air, one on the ground and a baby, with no flower or hive near,
// which wander, hovering and flying, `BeeWanderGoal`, look for flowers and find none, and the baby
// follows the nearest grown bee; then it watches them for 30 seconds.
fn beeflight_steps() -> List<(str, str)> {
    return [
        ("time set day", "beeflight-day"),
        ("gamemode creative", "beeflight-creative"),
        ("summon bee 4.5 -57 8.5", "beeflight-aloft"),
        ("summon bee 10.5 -60 8.5", "beeflight-ground"),
